      "@id": "fair2:graphDigestMultibase",
      "@type": "rdf:Property",
      "rdfs:comment": "Multibase-encoded multihash of the RDFC-1.0 canonical form of a fair2.json, as sha2-256 over the canonical n-quads. Companion to sec:digestMultibase, which covers the published bytes: the byte digest proves the file is unchanged, this one proves the graph is, so a document that was reserialised can be recognised as equivalent rather than reported as altered.",
      "rdfs:label": "graphDigestMultibase",
