      "rdfs:comment": "Version of the fair2.json document itself, as MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH. Independent of schema:version, which is the dataset's own release: a dataset at 1.2 may have a metadata document at 1.3.2 after several corrections. Patch for a metadata-only correction, minor for an additive change, major for a structural one.",
